OL,3,AThe Indian workers filming their work
OL,4,Ato train AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FMohammed Ashim has been cutting hair
OL,7,Fand trimming beards for four years in
OL,8,FBengaluru.
OL,10,FBut recently the 22-year old has been
OL,11,Fstrapping a camera to his head to
OL,12,Frecord his work.
OL,14,FThe camera only records his hands and
OL,15,Ffingers - his client's faces are
OL,16,Fblurred out.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
