OL,3,AZuckerberg wins Meta deal to help him
OL,4,Afoot bill for possible California
OL,5,Abillionaire tax
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeta has agreed to a new deal with
OL,8,Fchief executive Mark Zuckerberg to
OL,9,Fprevent him from leaving California
OL,10,Fover a proposed state tax on
OL,11,Fbillionaires.
OL,13,FThe agreement gives Zuckerberg, whose
OL,14,Fwealth is estimated to exceed $200bn
OL,15,F(#149bn), even more shares in Meta to
OL,16,Fmake up for the fraction of his fortune
OL,17,Fhe may lose if the tax wins voter
OL,18,Fapproval in November.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
