OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792745299
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARace to update services' computer
OL,4,Asystems after cyber-security flaw found
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers warned the "severe" flaws
OL,7,Fcould expose millions of sites using it
OL,8,Fto potential hacks if left unpatched -
OL,9,Fand the UK government was among those
OL,10,Fto take some sites offline as a
OL,11,Fprecaution.
OL,13,FThere have been no successful attacks
OL,14,Freported so far, but experts say any
OL,15,Fimpact may take time - even months - to
OL,16,Fbecome fully apparent.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
