OL,3,ARaye wins the Mercury Prize with This
OL,4,AMusic May Contain Hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the first time a pop album has
OL,7,Fwon the coveted prize - which
OL,8,Frecognises the best British or Irish
OL,9,Falbum of the last 12 months - since M
OL,10,FPeople's Elegant Slumming in 1994.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
