OL,3,AUS actor Tom Skerritt, star of Top Gun,
OL,4,ASteel Magnolias and Alien, dies aged 93
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS actor Tom Skerritt, who starred in
OL,7,Fthe TV series Picket Fences and the
OL,8,Ffilms Alien and Top Gun, has died aged
OL,9,F93, his family says.
OL,11,FSkerritt died on Wednesday of natural
OL,12,Fcauses, his family said, adding: "While
OL,13,Fthe world knew Tom through his
OL,14,Fremarkable acting career, we knew him
OL,15,Ffor his humour, curiosity, wisdom,
OL,16,Fgenerosity and the love he brought into
OL,17,Four lives."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
